      "description": "Current-page lavender is carried by a tonal rounded surface.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\">About</a><a href=\"/projects/\" aria-current=\"page\">Projects</a><a href=\"/experience/\">Experience</a><a href=\"/skills/\">Skills</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;font-family:var(--sans,'IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',sans-serif);}.ds-nav a{display:block;padding:.65rem 1rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--secondary,#bdb9ce);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.65;border-radius:7px;}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--ink,#f2e9e4);background:var(--surface,#292940);}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{color:var(--accent,#c7b9f3);background:var(--surface-raised,#32324c);}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#d2c1ff);outline-offset:5px;}"
